<title>USA: Regal Cinemas sees Q3 charge for Cobb deal.</title>
<headline>Regal Cinemas sees Q3 charge for Cobb deal.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regal Cinemas said Thursday that it completed its stock and debt acquisition of Cobb Theatres, taking a charge in the process.</p>
<p>Regal said in a statement that it expects to take a $4 million charge in its third quarter ending Oct 2 due to the acquisition.</p>
<p>Regal said the terms of the previously announced deal valued at $200 million included the exchange of more than 2.8 million of its shares, plus the assumption of $110 million of Cobb's liabilities.</p>
</text>
